# Jeuno in Ru'Lude Gardens with the Letter to the Ambassador. Status 0: Goggehn answers his own 101, the door _6r2 its
# own message. Status 1: Goggehn 41, whose finish takes the letter and sets status 2. Status 2: Goggehn 66; the door its
# own two messages. Status 3: Goggehn's first trigger plays his own 101 (a plain event alternates with the NPC default),
# the second the mission's 139; the door 38, whose finish completes the mission (5000 gil, rank 4); then Goggehn's own
# 101 (Magicite's section 1 4 loses to the alternation after the plain 139).
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1001 BastokMines/Rashid/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/1001 Metalworks/Lucius/onTrigger Metalworks/Malduc/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/322 Metalworks/onEventFinish/1001 PortBastok/Argus/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/1001 RuludeGardens/_6r2/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Goggehn/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/38 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/41 LowerDelkfuttsTower/_542/onTrade LowerDelkfuttsTower/_542/onTrigger LowerDelkfuttsTower/onEventFinish/1
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=3,9,-76 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
mission Bastok WadingBeasts completed
mission Bastok TheEmissary completed
mission Bastok TheFourMusketeers completed
mission Bastok ToTheForsakenMines completed
mission Bastok Jeuno current
keyitem LetterToTheAmbassador
login
trigger Goggehn                         # status 0: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
trigger _6r2                            # status 0: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 1
trigger Goggehn                         # 41
finish                                  # status 2, the letter taken
trigger Goggehn                         # 66
finish-if-event
trigger _6r2                            # status 2: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 3
trigger Goggehn                         # the NPC's own 101: a plain event alternates with the default
finish-if-event
trigger Goggehn                         # 139
finish-if-event
trigger _6r2                            # 38
finish                                  # completed: 5000 gil, rank 4
trigger Goggehn                         # completed: his own 101; Magicite's section 1 4 loses
finish-if-event
